{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>常常在 iPhone 上重複複製同一段文字，或需要在不同 App 之間來回貼上內容，Cliptyd 可把最近 20 次剪貼記錄放進鍵盤，方便隨時選用。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合經常處理文字、筆記與訊息的使用者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-231.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>鍵盤取用最近剪貼記錄</h2>\n<p>Cliptyd 保留最近 20 次複製記錄，按最新次序排列，鍵盤上方可取用最新一筆，亦提供完整輸入鍵盤。點按項目可再次複製，滑動可刪除，並可隨時暫停儲存；其他 App 標示為敏感內容時會跳過。記錄只存於 iPhone，無帳戶、無廣告、無追蹤。使用剪貼記錄須為鍵盤開啟「允許完整取用」，輸入按鍵則仍可使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-50.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-51.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-52.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-53.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Cliptyd</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cliptyd/id6830334466?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:04:14.309055+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:55:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:57.625372+00:0